{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.8 — runtime patches.

  1. Cart drawer speed: /cart/change.js already returns the full cart, but
     besjaar-ui-core.js discards it and reads /cart.js again. Serve that follow-up
     read from the change.js response (one-shot, 1.5 s window).
  2. Product gallery: warm the images the thumbnails will request —
     neighbours on idle, everything after the first touch, the touched thumb
     immediately. Never on data-saver / 2G.
  3. Phones: no backdrop-filter on the drawer backdrop, toast, zoom button
     and hero pill while things animate.
  4. Home product cards: the "Shop nu" text link becomes a full-width
     outlined button, and cards stretch to equal height with the button
     anchored at the bottom so a row of buttons lines up.
  5. Mobile menu, tile layout: navy "Shop alles" button, category tiles,
     icon rows for the pages, a 2×2 icon grid for the "Meer" links, account
     row, compact language pill and a trust line — everything visible, no
     accordions. Built by re-arranging the existing links, so the theme's
     open/close logic and every href stay untouched.
  6. Home colour rhythm: ice hero with a sky glow and a two-tone headline,
     navy trust strip, white range, navy-veiled scene, ice feature band,
     white reviews, navy CTA with a white title. Kickers in blue on light
     bands, sky on navy.
  7. Product accordion: the details panels are exclusive (besjaar-1150.js
     closes the others), so opening a lower panel collapsed the long
     description above it and the page jumped. The tapped heading now stays
     where it was: the scroll position is compensated for the collapsed
     height.
  8. Product delivery promise: only the delivery estimate shows on the
     product page, full width, styled like the trust tiles (the returns and
     warranty cards duplicated the tiles and clipped on phones).
  9. Trust strip ticker: when the strip overflows (phones), the items scroll
     continuously (seamless loop from a cloned, aria-hidden set), pause on
     hover/focus, and stay static under prefers-reduced-motion or when
     everything fits.
 10. Feature cards link to the showerhead collection: a stretched link
     covers each card (labelled with the card title) and a short call to
     action line is appended to the card body.
 11. Home CTA 360° spin: the static image in the closing CTA is replaced
     by the theme's own 360 viewer (assets/besjaar-ui-360.js, loaded on demand).
     Frame source, in order of preference: the 36 frames cut from the studio
     spin video (besjaar-cta-360-01.webp … -36.webp) in Shopify Files, else
     the same files as theme assets, else the theme's bundled 23-frame spin
     (assets/besjaar-360-01..23.webp), else the still image stays. Rotates
     continuously, drag / arrow keys to rotate, resumes after a drag, pauses
     off-screen, no autoplay under prefers-reduced-motion.

  (The compact cart-drawer redesign that briefly lived here was reverted on
  request; the drawer renders exactly as the 11.2.40 layer styles it.)

  Temporary carrier like besjaar-tokens-1164. During the consolidation, fold
  (1) into refreshCart(cart) in besjaar-ui-core.js, (2)+(7) into the product page
  scripts, (3) into the mobile CSS, (4)+(6)+(9) into the home CSS/JS, (5)
  into the mobile menu markup in sections/site-header.liquid, (8) into
  snippets/delivery-promise.liquid, (10) into sections/besjaar-store-features.liquid
  as a real <a> per card, (11) into sections/besjaar-store-cta.liquid as a proper
  viewer block.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bj_ship_money = settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign bj_menu_t1 = 'besjaar_ui.product.free_shipping_from' | t: amount: bj_ship_money
  assign bj_menu_t2 = 'besjaar_ui.product.returns_days' | t: days: settings.return_window_days
  assign bj_menu_foot = bj_menu_t1 | append: ' · ' | append: bj_menu_t2
  assign bj_menu_cat = 'Categorieën'
  assign bj_menu_more = 'Meer'
  case request.locale.iso_code
    when 'en'
      assign bj_menu_cat = 'Categories'
      assign bj_menu_more = 'More'
    when 'de'
      assign bj_menu_cat = 'Kategorien'
      assign bj_menu_more = 'Mehr'
    when 'fr'
      assign bj_menu_cat = 'Catégories'
      assign bj_menu_more = 'Plus'
  endcase
-%}
<script type="application/json" id="bj-menu-config">{"foot":{{ bj_menu_foot | json }},"categories":{{ bj_menu_cat | json }},"more":{{ bj_menu_more | json }}}</script>
{%- if request.page_type == 'index' -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign bj_360_hint = 'Sleep om te draaien'
    assign bj_360_label = 'Besjaar douchekop, 360° weergave — sleep om te draaien'
    case request.locale.iso_code
      when 'en'
        assign bj_360_hint = 'Drag to rotate'
        assign bj_360_label = 'Besjaar showerhead, 360° view — drag to rotate'
      when 'de'
        assign bj_360_hint = 'Ziehen zum Drehen'
        assign bj_360_label = 'Besjaar Duschkopf, 360°-Ansicht — zum Drehen ziehen'
      when 'fr'
        assign bj_360_hint = 'Glissez pour faire tourner'
        assign bj_360_label = 'Pommeau de douche Besjaar, vue à 360° — glissez pour tourner'
    endcase
  -%}
  <script type="application/json" id="bj-cta-360-frames" data-script="{{ 'besjaar-ui-360.js' | asset_url }}" data-hint="{{ bj_360_hint | escape }}" data-label="{{ bj_360_label | escape }}">{"files":[{%- for i in (1..36) -%}{%- assign bj_n = i | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 -%}{%- assign bj_file = 'besjaar-cta-360-' | append: bj_n | append: '.webp' -%}{"url":{{ bj_file | file_url | json }},"alt":{{ bj_360_label | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}],"assets":[{%- for i in (1..36) -%}{%- assign bj_n = i | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 -%}{%- assign bj_file = 'besjaar-cta-360-' | append: bj_n | append: '.webp' -%}{"url":{{ bj_file | asset_url | json }},"alt":{{ bj_360_label | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}],"bundled":[{%- for i in (1..23) -%}{%- assign bj_n = i | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 -%}{%- assign bj_asset = 'besjaar-360-' | append: bj_n | append: '.webp' -%}{"url":{{ bj_asset | asset_url | json }},"alt":{{ bj_360_label | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}]}</script>
{%- endif -%}
