   categories forced into two columns so product names wrapped. Every item
   looked like a separate box, which gave the menu no hierarchy. Now a single
   white surface with full-width rows separated by hairlines - the pattern
   used by most large retail sites. Class names are unchanged, so the runtime
   script that builds this menu needs no edit. */
